{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Hey, I got dragged in here by a barker!": "",
  "Hmph. You young folks will nitpick anything these days. Degenerates, all of you.": "",
  "Your whole generation is a bunch of degenerate goblins.": "",
  "(The only degenerate in here is you, lady.)": "",
  "(So that's where the money goes that she rips off the customers.)": "",
  "(Pisses me off that my money's about to go there too.)": "",
  "(That's a helluva lot of cigarette butts. Does she smoke that much?)": "",
  "(Maybe it's a customer, or maybe it's her barker husband?)": "",
  "(Either way, maybe I can break out of this...)": "",
  "(They must have a bathroom... Maybe I can get out that way.)": "",
  "Hey... You mind if I use the bathroom real quick?": "",
  "If you pay first.": "",
  "I'm leaking here, lady.": "",
  "If your plan is to escape from the bathroom, don't even think about it.": "",
  "Do that in the bathroom!": "",
  "That's not what I meant!": "",
  "Shit! You got me, lady...": "",
  "But don't think for a second that this is over.": "",
  "I'll get my money back. In my own way.": "",
  "(She's right that the police would never bother with fraud like this... So I guess I'll have to stoop to her level.)": "",
  "(If I catch her in the middle of an affair, that'll be all the bargaining chips I need.)": "",
  "Mmhm. I just got off work, darling.": "",
  "Yup, I'm good! I'll see you soon... Hehe.": "",
  "(She was laying the charm on thick... That had to have been a guy on the other end.)": "",
  "(This is looking more and more like I might just get the affair I'm after.)": "",
  "(Heh, yep, trailing this lady is the right call.)": "",
  "(I'll get my money back... And she'll pay for taking it!)": "",
  "(All right. Just gotta follow her without getting seen.)": "",
  "Were you waiting long, baby?": "",
  "Oh no, I just got here!": "",
  "It's been sooo long, hasn't it, Tsubasa? So... Do you have anything <font_kind=yakuza_italic>long</font_kind> you want to give me?": "",
  "Damn, Maki. It's only been three days, hasn't it?": "",
  "(Ah, she's seeing that host. No wonder she needed 100,000 yen... These guys aren't cheap.)": "",
  "I see you took off your ring. I'm proud of you.": "",
  "Oh, Tsubasa... I'm a virgin every night for you.": "",
  "Really? That mean you want me to pop that cherry tonight?": "",
  "Mhmm. I'll give you every part of me...": "",
  "(Haha, wow, dude. He's just doing his job, but he keeps up with her like it's nothing.)": "",
  "Hello, ma'am. Did I catch you feeling thirsty?": "",
  "Y-You...! What are you doing here!?": "",
  "What do you think of this pic? Your face came out really nice, I think.": "",
  "Didn't you tell your husband you'd quit the host club thing? I wonder what he'd think about this photo?": "",
  "H-Hand that over!": "",
  "Woah, let's not get grabby.": "",
  "Hey! Who the hell are you!?": "",
  "Nobody in particular, cougar bait. Or would you say this is just part of the job?": "",
  "Tsubasa loves me, you moron!": "",
  "Y-Yeah, totally, Maki.": "",
  "Then won't you kick this guy's ass for me? You said you work out, didn't you?": "",
  "I'll give you 50,000! Er, no! Make it 100,000!": "",
  "Sounds like a good deal to me!": "",
  "(So he's in it for the paycheck after all.)": "",
  "Let's go, asshole! You think you can step up to my lady like that!? I'll go easy on you if you don't hit my face!": "",
  "Ow... I told you not to touch my face...": "",
  "T-Tsubasa! Are you okay!?": "",
  "Well, ma'am, what's next on your list?": "",
  "I-I'll give you 50,000! Just delete that picture!": "",
  "I say we make it 100,000.": "",
  "Th-That much!? It's just a picture!": "",
  "Sure, the picture comes cheap, but there's a service fee for deleting it... And my world class photography.": "",
  "What's with that stare!? Are you sizing me up, you creep!?": "",
  "Just thinking that you must still have the money you ripped off me, right? Why not just return that?": "",
  "F-Fine! I'll give it back! Just don't tell my husband about this!": "",
  "Yo! You look like you need a drink, man.": "",
  "Maki... What were you doing with that guy?": "",
  "O-Oh, nothing...": "",
  "Don't tell me you were at that host club again!?": "",
  "N-No, why would I...": "",
  "What is it then, huh!?": "",
  "I'm sorrrrrrrrrrry!": "",
  "I'm glad I got my money back... But I'm annoyed for getting conned in the first place. More at myself than anything.": "",
  "Just goes to show, you can't let your guard down in Kamurocho, no matter how well you think you know it...": "",
  "(If I could just get evidence of that...)": "",
  "(I could use it to \"negotiate\" the return of my money...)": "",
  "(No ring that I can see... But then again, it's her right hand, so...)": "",
  "(Maybe if I check her left though...)": "",
  "(If she's having an affair, she'd take off her ring for sure...)": "",
  "(This could be worth looking into.)": "",
  "(Nice. She's not gonna be able to deny anything when it's this close.)": "",
  "(She told her husband she'd stopped going to the host clubs... I think I've got the perfect angle for this.)": "",
  "(And the photo is just icing on the cake.)": "",
  "(Hmm, I could've gotten closer I think, but this should still be fine.)": "",
  "(All right, I need a good pic of this. Something she can't talk her way out of.)": "",
  "(That necklace is the star of the ensemble, too.)": "",
  "What the hell, how come I keep missing! Are you some kind of mutant?": "",
  "Hahaha, you mad? You can try again any time you like... I could use some extra pocket change!": "",
  "Hey, you mind telling me what's going on here?": "",
  "What, you don't know? Then let me introduce myself. The name's Tanago, but you can call me... Mr. Try and Hit Me!": "",
  "...Are you serious?": "",
  "I'm dead serious. If you can hit me even once within a thirty-second time limit, I'll give you 50,000 yen.": "",
  "I gotta warn you though! Out of all my 200 matches, I haven't lost a single one. Think you can break that record?": "",
  "All I need to do is hit you, right? Sounds easy enough.": "",
  "Heh. You say that now, but I bet you'll end up sprawled out on the ground like everyone else who challenged me!": "",
  "Heh heh heh. And you know what I love seeing more than anything else? Embarrassing arrogant pricks like you!": "",
  "So. If you think you got what it takes, then put your money where your mouth is! It's 5,000 yen per try.": "",
  "Oh, I don't have that much...": "",
  "Hey, you gotta pay to play! Actually bring your wallet next time!": "",
  "Nope, not today.": "",
  "Weak! Whatever though. I can keep myself occupied.": "",
  "Hah, I thought I might see you around! 5,000 yen, same as always. You ready for the challenge of a lifetime?": "",
  "I'll take you on.": "",
  "Hahaha, that's more like it! Let's do this!": "",
  "I, The Great Tanago, prophesy that you won't land a single hit on me, and you'll end up hitting the pavement instead!": "",
  "Interesting. Then I'll just have to shatter that prophecy of yours.": "",
  "Hah... Can't touch this!": "",
  "Not really. More like I can see through all your slow-ass moves!": "",
  "Damn... You're fast.": "",
  "Oof... Hah... Man... You got me... Me, of all people! ...How?": "",
  "I simply aimed my punches wherever I thought you would dodge. No prophecies needed.": "",
  "Whoa, that guy actually hit him? No friggin' way! It's like he was doing some crazy kung fu shit!": "",
  "Yeah, he was fast as lightning! ...It was even a little bit frightening.": "",
  "Man, you're fast. You've got the moves all right—I've never seen anything like 'em! Here. You earned this.": "",
  "But damn... This feeling in my chest... It hurts... So this is the pain of defeat! Who... Who are you, man?": "",
  "I'm Yagami. Sorry I didn't pull any punches. You were actually pretty hard to hit.": "",
  "That's a real nice way of saying I'm a loser. But I get it. I couldn't make the cut.": "",
  "Don't be so hard on yourself. It must've taken a ton of work just to get to where you are today. Not many can do that.": "",
  "Well... I did have a pretty strict teacher.": "",
  "Someone actually taught you to be like this?": "",
  "Damn straight. He was the previous Mr. Try and Hit Me before I took up his mantle. I admired his way of thinking...": "",
  "Back in the day, I was just another punk, trying to hit whatever and whoever I could. But I could never hit him.": "",
  "I see. He must've been quite strong.": "",
  "He was. And thanks to you, Yagami-san, his memory's been rekindled in my heart. I owe you one.": "",
  "Now I have a new goal in mind. I'm gonna train. Over and over. And then I'm gonna dodge every punch you throw at me!": "",
  "All right! I'll be stepping up my game from here on out, so you better watch yourself next time!": "",
  "That's the spirit. Then I'll try and hit you with everything I've got.": "",
  "(You sure picked one hell of a job, Tanago...)": "",
  "(At least I know who to visit next time I feel like hitting someone.)": "",
  "Man, I lost again... Is there really anyone out there who can hit this guy?": "",
  "Oh, there is. And I won't be losing to anyone until I face him again.": "",
  "H-Hey, aren't you—!?": "",
  "Yo. It's been a while.": "",
  "So we meet again at last. I've been looking forward to a rematch. Ready to punch some air?": "",
  "Well aren't you all fired up.": "",
  "Oh yeah, I've been training day in and day out for this moment. I'm practically untouchable now!": "",
  "Still costs 5,000 yen per round, though. So are you gonna try and hit me or what?": "",
  "Hey, you gotta pay to play. Actually bring your wallet next time!": "",
  "Hah, I thought I might see you around! 5,000 yen, same as always. Ready to eat pavement?": "",
  "Heheh. Oh, I am <font_kind=yakuza_italic>so</font_kind> looking forward to this!": "",
  "Allow me a brief divination. I see with my mind's eye... a challenger... But what's this? He's on his knees in defeat!?": "",
  "You need to take your mind's eye to an optometrist... because I see a much different future.": "",
  "Woo-haa! Can't touch this, baby!": "",
  "Dang... I didn't think I'd lose.": "",
  "Don't feel too bad, you've got moves too... I just happen to have much more! Ahaha yeah...": "",
  "Tch... Next time for sure...": "",
  "(There's nothing I can do right now. I'll need to come back when I'm faster.)": "",
  "Holy... *gasp* ...shit! Can't believe you beat me... twice!": "",
  "But, a deal's a deal. Take the money!": "",
  "I must say, you are quite something. Take it from someone who's always running into one knucklehead after another...": "",
  "I still have yet to see a guy who can dodge like you.": "",
  "...Heh, what can I say? The previous Mr. Try and Hit Me taught me well.": "",
  "He was like a god among men. His feet could move mountains if they wanted to... ": "",
  "But I'm nowhere near his level...": "",
  "Tell me. What can a man do to push himself past his limits?": "",
  "...Hmm, the only thing I can say is practice. Not just dodging, though.": "",
  "You mean, I need to practice throwing punches too?": "",
  "Yeah. Wouldn't it be easier to predict your enemy's movements if you knew how they would attack?": "",
  "Huh. Maybe. All I've really been doing is focusing on my footwork...": "",
  "But if I also learn the mindset of the attacker... Yeah, that might just be the paradigm shift I need!": "",
  "No doubt. Being able to read your opponent will boost your evasion tenfold.": "",
  "For example, whenever someone gets difficult with me, the first thing I do is visualize how I want to strike.": "",
  "Word...": "",
  "Then what you're saying is... I need to get in fights more often? Haha, I can do that! Yeah! I'm gonna bust some heads!": "",
  "Yeah, I don't think so. Randomly picking fights with people is exactly what I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>don't</font_kind> want to see you doing.": "",
  "You'd be no different from a street punk. And then I'd have to lay the smackdown on you.": "",
  "I... I guess you're right. But then... what should I do?": "",
  "...Why don't you be my backup? There are plenty of punks in town who seem to have it out for me, so I could use the help.": "",
  "You want me to help you... throw down? I can dig that.": "",
  "Yeah! I'll be busting up the bad guys <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> busting out some slick evasive maneuvers. Count me in!": "",
  "Good, 'cause dealing with the Keihin Gang on my own is getting to be a headache.": "",
  "No worries man, I got you! If I see anyone tryna step to you, I'll swoop down on them with the quickness!": "",
  "One word of caution, though. These are real gangsters we're talking about here. They might even pull out some weapons.": "",
  "Heh, no worries. Knives and bats are nothing compared to your terrifying fists of fury!": "",
  "Well, as long as you don't get hit, huh.": "",
  "Hah, they can try all they want, but people don't call me Mr. Try and Hit Me for nothing! Let's see what they got!": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san! Fighting scrubs actually makes me miss getting hit by you. Catch you later!": "",
  "(It's 300 yen a go. Which course should I choose?)": "",
  "(I'm too poor to even hit a few balls... This is my life, I guess.)": "",
  "(...Eh, another time.)": "",
  "Yo, how 'bout a bit of mahjong? As you can probably tell, we're not really the greatest players in the world.": "",
  "If you wanna play, it'll cost ya 12,500 yen.": "",
  "Mkay, then. Fork up that cool 12,500.": "",
  "Damn shame... I guess just come back when you wanna play with us.": "",
  "Hey, you wanna play mahjong with us? It'll run ya 12,500 yen if you do.": "",
  "That was a real hoot. Come back sometime, ya hear?": "",
  "You up for some mahjong? We're kinda good, if I do say so myself.": "",
  "If you're looking to jump in, you'll have to pay the 25,000 yen entry fee.": "",
  "All righty. Just hand over that 25,000 and we'll be ready to go.": "",
  "Well that's a downer... Let me know if you ever wanna play, okay?": "",
  "You down to throw down, mahjong style? It'll cost you 25,000 to play at this table.": "",
  "They say luck changes with the tides... Well, let's give it another go sometime.": "",
  "No, never mind.": "",
  "Sure, let's see what it's all about.": "",
  "Next time...": "",
  "Sure, I'll give it a shot.": "",
  "Nah, I'll pass.": "",
  "Are you interested in some mahjong? We're all pretty decent players.": "",
  "If you'd like to join us, we only ask that you put up 25,000 yen.": "",
  "Wonderful. I'll be taking that 25,000 then.": "",
  "Oh, I see... Well then, come speak to us again if you're ever interested.": "",
  "Do you want to play with us? You'll just need to put in 25,000 yen to join.": "",
  "That was a good match. Let's play together again sometime.": "",
  "Could I interest you in a round of mahjong? Though I must warn you, we're pros.": "",
  "If you wish to participate, we require that you place a 50,000 yen bet.": "",
  "Splendid. Now the 50,000, please.": "",
  "How unfortunate. If you ever wish to put your mahjong mettle to the test, please return to us.": "",
  "Has our table piqued your interest? You'll need to place a 50,000 yen bet to join us.": "",
  "My word... That result was quite unexpected. Let's play again in the near future.": "",
  "...You want to join us? ...You better know what you're getting into.": "",
  "...Hand over 250,000 if you're gonna join.": "",
  "Alright, pay up 250,000.": "",
  "Got cold feet, huh? ...Come back where you're ready.": "",
  "...You want to join our game? ...Come back with 250,000.": "",
  "...Leave if you had enough.": "",
  "Oh, you want to join our game of wareme rules mahjong? We're pretty weak, just so you know.": "",
  "Huh? You're not joining? Talk to us whenever you feel like playing.": "",
  "Oh, you want to join our game of wareme rules mahjong? Then make sure that you have 12,500.": "",
  "How was the wareme rule? Join us again.": "",
  "Wanna play wareme rules mahjong? We're pretty average.": "",
  "Pay 25,000 if you want to join.": "",
  "All right, I'll take the 25,000 then.": "",
  "What, you don't wanna play? Come back anytime you want.": "",
  "You wanna play wareme rules mahjong? Then you'll need to bring 25,000.": "",
  "The wareme rule is pretty wild, right? Let's play again.": "",
  "Wanna play wareme rules mahjong? Just to let you know, we're good.": "",
  "Pay 50,000 if you wanna join.": "",
  "All right, I'll be taking the 50,000 then.": "",
  "I see. Well, we're always here so come back anytime.": "",
  "You wanna play wareme rules mahjong? Then you'll need to have 50,000.": "",
  "Thanks. Let us know when you want to play with skilled players.": "",
  "(It's locked. It would be hard to try and pick the lock with no lights.)": "",
  "(Right now, it's important that I help Kaito-san.)": "",
  "(Shit... It's too dark for me to aim...)": "",
  "(All right, work can wait!)": "",
  "(Fighting Vipers is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Motor Raid is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Kamuro of the Dead is 500 yen per play? Wow. Should I, though?)": "",
  "(Fantasy Zone is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Space Harrier is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Virtua Fighter 5 Final Showdown is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Puyo Puyo is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Virtua Fighter 2 is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Virtua Fighter 2.1 is 100 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Should I play some Out Run?)": "",
  "Hey, pal! You up for some koi-koi?": "",
  "Sure, let's play.": "",
  "Hm? Looks like you don't have the points. Need at least 200 points for koi-koi.": "",
  "Come back again.": "",
  "All right, step this way!": "",
  "Nah, I'm gonna pass.": "",
  "That so? Come back later then, y'hear?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's not what I meant!": "เปล่า ไม่ใช่แบบนั้นนะ!?",
  "Hey! Who the hell are you!?": "เฮ้! พวกแกเป็นใครวะ!?",
  "I'll take you on.": "งั้นมาสิ จะเล่นด้วย",
  "If you wanna play, it'll cost ya 12,500 yen.": "ถ้าอยากเล่นก็จ่ายมา 12,500 เยน",
  "Mkay, then. Fork up that cool 12,500.": "โอเค งั้นควักมา 12,500 เลยเพื่อน",
  "Hey, you wanna play mahjong with us? It'll run ya 12,500 yen if you do.": "เฮ้ อยากเล่นมาจองกับพวกเราไหม? ถ้าเล่นต้องเสีย 12,500 เยนนะ",
  "That was a real hoot. Come back sometime, ya hear?": "สนุกชะมัดเลยว่ะ ไว้กลับมาอีกนะ เข้าใจ๊?",
  "You up for some mahjong? We're kinda good, if I do say so myself.": "อยากเล่นมาจองไหม? พวกเราเก่งเอาเรื่องเลยนะถ้าจะให้พูดเอง",
  "If you're looking to jump in, you'll have to pay the 25,000 yen entry fee.": "ถ้าอยากร่วมด้วย ต้องเสียค่าเข้าร่วม 25,000 เยนนะ",
  "They say luck changes with the tides... Well, let's give it another go sometime.": "เขาว่าโชคเปลี่ยนได้ตามกระแสน้ำ... เอาน่า ไว้มาลองกันใหม่นะ",
  "No, never mind.": "ไม่ ช่างเถอะ",
  "Sure, let's see what it's all about.": "เอาสิ ขอลองดูหน่อยว่าเป็นยังไง",
  "Sure, I'll give it a shot.": "ได้ จะลองดู",
  "Nah, I'll pass.": "ไม่ล่ะ ขอผ่าน",
  "If you'd like to join us, we only ask that you put up 25,000 yen.": "ถ้าอยากร่วมด้วย ขอแค่ 25,000 เยนก็พอ",
  "Wonderful. I'll be taking that 25,000 then.": "เยี่ยมเลยครับ งั้นผมขอรับ 25,000 นั้นเลยนะครับ",
  "That was a good match. Let's play together again sometime.": "แมตช์นี้ดีมากเลย มาเล่นด้วยกันอีกนะสักวัน",
  "If you wish to participate, we require that you place a 50,000 yen bet.": "ถ้าอยากร่วมเล่น ต้องวางเดิมพัน 50,000 เยนนะ",
  "Splendid. Now the 50,000, please.": "วิเศษมากครับ งั้นขอรับ 50,000 เลยครับ",
  "How unfortunate. If you ever wish to put your mahjong mettle to the test, please return to us.": "น่าเสียดายจริงๆ ถ้าอยากพิสูจน์ฝีมือมาจองเมื่อไหร่ก็ กลับมาหาพวกเราได้นะ",
  "Sure, let's play.": "เอาสิ เล่นก็เล่น",
  "Hm? Looks like you don't have the points. Need at least 200 points for koi-koi.": "อืม? ดูเหมือนแต้มไม่พอนะ ต้องมีอย่างน้อย 200 แต้มถึงจะเล่นโคอิโคอิได้",
  "Come back again.": "แวะมาอีกนะ",
  "All right, step this way!": "เอาล่ะ เชิญทางนี้เลย!",
  "Nah, I'm gonna pass.": "ไม่ล่ะ ขอผ่านก่อน",
  "That so? Come back later then, y'hear?": "งั้นเหรอ? ไว้ค่อยกลับมาใหม่ล่ะ ได้ยินไหม?"
 }
}
